blocks.text:
Coordination. The correct timing and sequencing of muscle firing combined with the appropriate intensity of muscular contraction leading to the effective initiation, guiding,
and grading of movement. It is the basis of smooth, accurate, efficient movement and occurs at a conscious or automatic level.123,127 Flexibility. The ability to move freely, without restriction;
used interchangeably with mobility.

